    "note": "So the cabinet stood, and stands: Monday, the Crimson (Mars); Tuesday, the Lead-white (Saturn); Wednesday, the Bone (Mercury); Thursday, the Verdigris (Venus); Friday, the Amber (Sun); Saturday, the Ochre (Jupiter); Sunday, the Ultramarine (Moon). And Saturday's drawer held the Ochre — tin, Jupiter's metal. The cabinet keeps its own order; the almanac may see to its own."
